PTY loop case passed: repeated exact media seeks, deterministic rebuild, no duplicate requests, terminal restored.
PTY debugger case passed: four panes, frozen core, missing feedback, pause/resize/seek, nine original requests, terminal restored.
PTY default EOF case passed: immediate finish, one deletion, no Easter-egg event, terminal restored.
PTY default hold case passed: DELETED retained until explicit quit, no implicit Easter egg.
PTY EOF case passed: no early exit, silent pause/resize/resume, one Easter egg, no music replay, automatic finish.
PTY tail-entry case passed: direct post-EOF start, rewind to media, deterministic history, hold final frame, explicit quit.

